+/**
+ * struct omci_fec_counters - downstream FEC totals of the PON line
+ * @generation: changes when the totals restart from zero
+ * @corrected_bytes: bytes corrected by FEC
+ * @corrected_codewords: code words corrected by FEC
+ * @uncorrectable_codewords: code words FEC could not correct
